# Native folders are COMMITTED, not generated on CI.
#
# codemagic.yaml builds with `cd android && ./gradlew assembleRelease` and never
# runs `expo prebuild`, so android/ has to exist in the clone. It also holds
# hand-maintained sources (CallForegroundService*.kt, the LiveKit init in
# MainApplication.kt) that a prebuild would overwrite — keeping them tracked is
# what makes those changes reviewable instead of silently lost.
#
# android/.gitignore already excludes build/, .gradle, local.properties and
# .cxx/, so only ~1MB of real sources is tracked.
#
# Consequence: do NOT run `expo prebuild` casually — it rewrites these files.
# If you must (e.g. an Expo SDK upgrade), run it, then review `git diff` and
# re-apply anything it clobbered. plugins/withCallKeep.js holds the recipe for
# the custom native bits.
/ios
